  "description": "Run up there with those legs! A story of an epic sprint! \n\nAyumu, the protagonist, is always being chased by someone, whether in kindergarten or elementary school. Then there's Koga Igari of Ougawa Academy, who won the 100m race at the national track and field championships with overwhelming power. \"Prey\" and \"King.\" The two meet one day. Ayumu, who has always been bullied and running away, decides to hunt down the king waiting at the top of the ecosystem of the \"100m race\" with just his own legs!!! This is where his story of a dramatic reversal and growth begins.\n\n(Source: Shueisha, translated)",
